	(text "J2 listwa LV modulu BSS138:  1=LV(1,8V)  2=LV1  3=LV2  4=GND          J4 listwa HV tego samego modulu:  1=HV2  2=HV1  3=GND  4=HV(5V)          J3 listwa CH341A:  1=5V  2=3,3V  3=RXD  4=TXD  5=GND"
